						 <p>There is no such thing as being bad at taking care of plant.</p> <p>There is totally such thing as rebellious and turbulent angsty adolescent time of plant.</p> <p>Thanks to Photosynthetic for conceptualizing, Vivax and Dmatix for giving ideas way back when, and Tuomey, MisterFlames, Decibelles, ihpkmn (for the MCR bit), theworstninja, Voct, TwistedGears, Light, Athena_Grey, Clef, Roget, DrMann and everyone else on chat who reviewed it today.</p> <p>ETA: Image belongs to me. The picture is of my spider plant Zetsu, who has flowered three times since the writing of the article. I'm so proud he's growing up. *single tear*</p> 
